    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1442afdd80c106dd5d7b59c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "飞龙乘云",
      "source_fingerprint": "99ac02a1ce5fc22647a34a2ae734d3acdc9c212635d1515811b21b56c0e13a75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017321.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2516811a43fcd6fbd9b48357",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“皇帝”鲁道夫象征光是公布出道消息，\n便成了热门话题。\n不过本人面对世人的期待还是一样泰然自若。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f221e0203291c900869d7b5afccf5c8d4df8eb8021bf043d70b323560f86cd59",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a83520f36cab30bd14b362c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她气势充沛地说，\n自己的目标是经典三冠，并且会持续求胜，\n证明自己是真正的“皇帝”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ebb0549db8636e33d094f9c7d84b76362a9bbe86411c9c4fe956245d341c92d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecfd9e7dc275b5443427d4db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她最终的梦想是\n“打造能够让所有赛马娘幸福生活的世界”，\n伟大的挑战就此拉开序幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "043a7f31aadc4b5a6e061ae24c68811eb3b2ae1de574a176ae82fadbaeb9bbd4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f713defd7e36d96c67d07b9c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b416b693dfa30e96f7daf1d00faa4e7a4ac4f42a90e490404765cf3d71c48ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d20bb6d8a300d098b325585d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征身兼学生会的工作，\n还得进行严苛的训练。她的得力助手之一，\n副会长气槽似乎因此相当担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e3595d6efbc8f18ed05a7049701709aeba119240e8128fa1685c0e54f3d0b2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:810db6f0846db1b8b1f07917",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同为副会长的成田白仁态度粗鲁，\n但是有着关怀学生会新进庶务的一面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9b1d673406105f5005d03324e2ec6a1daef0a211b7cac832761217f637746ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2fcd5528d402db83f7cdbd9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征表示对她来说，\n有人跟随自己是一种鼓舞。这一天，\n她有稍稍流露出自己对学生会成员的感情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "173dc23bba14e7e444526b741cb32b7b2ce778a3740caed9dbc58fea5193dea6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7af0954f0521851b33b81352",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莫逆之交",
      "source_fingerprint": "a95bb5b35300751a494f726719bcbfab9c7e95347a06155d5e3ea136d1ff9f20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:348f65d911f273161c96a40c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当鲁道夫象征全神贯注地准备训练时，\n成田白仁报告说有问题发生了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa04db2c52cf756389f190edd7af98f4555e9470d4205940ce8b16584ac3b8ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08b8b4d0de3ffbfea2d19b1c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "担任庶务的赛马娘说\n不想造成伟大会长的负担，\n于是提出了辞职的请求。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cfd4c36f630c8a1f823fae5e8d639b75640bc4e1160add2cdae3adeb70557ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78d5e7df40fdffc8a7300453",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征于是想了个办法，\n那就是邀请她来看“皋月赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "437a8c3c8edd6ea9f5353a61c91569d3b012061eedf1a791482220cc252e4ae7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:880903a178c9118adca290f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "深思熟虑",
      "source_fingerprint": "e87e950acea5367421777b25d4ddb9f67c1cf0958c80436be8a1f1abcdff07fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6da557ab23e774c1a8f47598",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“日本德比”即将到来，\n鲁道夫象征为此专心一志地准备着。\n她这么拼命，让气槽相当担心她的身体状况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff2055f64eb516afdb592c6957f282cafbc055622c4848d66c7e3d1e515e78cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4299b3ef460ec54cd9ef9870",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽因此禁止她出入学生会办公室，\n打算借此减少她的负担，\n但是鲁道夫象征并不接受这个作法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b9164d2c6a3b93a73731aebff58036fb9343bb3bd7d9db6b4904374218d6b97",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3def5c9403738b3a0a9798bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "纵使她能揣测气槽的用心，\n不过她身为会长及“皇帝”，并未因此让步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66c8d99a7d1f6df9df4e8ca9f8c50e2332f49ae5cd39f6e1d443cd3a604826a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c3654e502a01d75bf1e145c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不协和音",
      "source_fingerprint": "85126f2e2024a3299f744885e6541ccf1a10630b0f28ab98815fee7fc47d08c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:410c230d4a00c3877a73151d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征在新年一开始\n就为了赛马娘四处奔波。\n这时候她收到了气槽昏倒的消息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a171f4a15432f32672023c6261d5f6e8e86f667a9ddd5d9d5021cd93824ab598",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b851829a5e444154e8e7a89",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽昏倒的原因单纯是过于疲劳，\n但是鲁道夫象征为此自责，\n认为自己身为会长却疏于关照她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c4b05d80c683865ef325a0c782662ef01e977f516c869a6a9b76d94382c8627",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba2dd0168b2e59384926d593",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，气槽责备了懊悔的鲁道夫象征。\n鲁道夫象征也相当认真看待气槽这番话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a59797fb610b038754e89f09c3ad432bc7907f58bd494524ca379bfe85bc8e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f70ce1eaf781a22d09eb7a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "满布疑云",
      "source_fingerprint": "30ff7ee48edfc55637582eb1a1e8807a715a75792d7dc4ae50206cc2c1d87d0e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e97c13a85dbbdd96e0680cb1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（春）”近在眼前。\n天天不得闲的鲁道夫象征\n今天也忙着接受采访。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaaaad2dc39da8164ad74591a14d73cf30d40ea4549289f7fa6f5764b0ce2209",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:067fd06d05ffe8bf1d2ed09c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在此时，\n希望赛马娘界能蓬勃发展的她满怀信心地宣布\n学园即将举办“粉丝‘大’感谢祭”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "665693821ab23e4b537ebe637fe47abd6d4b41f36d5b6dec0aeab52fb463bafd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82036d366f98e24599b06789",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这一刻的鲁道夫象征威风凛凛，\n她由于气槽的事，积极地想要获得\n更加深厚的信赖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92d1f3cc93e59429c9bd87438d332a1a0940f3fc637384859573f1c63332a65d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d83623ea98661c18e59fa668",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "更努力地工作、跑步，\n向众人夸耀完美无缺的“皇帝”之姿。\n这就是她承认自己不够成熟后所选择的答案。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c5941335ab15193c5a1ab0541a6a80de430c3f38ea100690fe800dfdcb0e37c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ab2c71414afd066d2bc104a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呕心沥血",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a5c35ccac5f91f5e6f27c91338ca6b4f3e1f60c1bf4f89432efc60307305d39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f657256932eb86405b4da97",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "粉丝感谢祭当天，\n鲁道夫象征利落地发号施令，处理问题。\n不过她似乎因为疲惫而罕见地犯了明显错误。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91d205365ffbbd69dd12d5cb0f20cd651b52a8fcf6285ed49be493e4d3f1b75f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c66ce49679fcf1320c47572a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使如此，鲁道夫象征仍然选择\n参加粉丝服务的一环──\n也就是出战表演赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83876f96cc41e560fb6943c1d10eb2dab0129d0bb7ba62966b5c10eb7c064817",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fb5fe18d1646e3cf93bea01",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所有人都期待她以“皇帝”之姿驰骋赛场。\n鲁道夫象征为了回应观众的盼望而起跑，\n结果却惨不忍睹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c745b7357d31af1b62e44c58a319088ffae88e31c4350b82607de35d83c4be2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0602b3775d125cb02fe7f683",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目睹“皇帝”失态的观众们议论纷纷，\n持续不止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04006d78e69711733b36c229382b84f8753a48a3cdcf46ceebac9c184e4e910f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f08167776177125c8fbfdef2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皇帝，丧失威严",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d4c672006462d943e08723c362aaee5f05566daceab5b08264289ae1c33fed4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d4216268275b1e550b59513",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征在表演赛中凄惨败北。\n为此，她自嘲不配当个“皇帝”，\n并流下了懊悔的泪水。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c7e46850f1d21ccd38be879b554ebd216a41845708b32ff67acba2267da3b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32847fd62734c1bd3dc8801d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是训练员温柔地肯定了\n鲁道夫象征至今的成就。而接下来的发展\n就像是在呼应训练员所说的话一样──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b9af96c9f2ffa1adc8b2d9bfbb0c4961af3c47a162b634e44d022f83be9c5e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:598a7410acbb0d973d74d000",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──许多赛马娘出现了。\n一路上受到鲁道夫象征协助的她们，\n为了成为她的支柱而集结于此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5446c9188a47f77b13958e89d246787dbfdb8f060cb1e6e04fe0a34724feed36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8098c17d26264ea8e632fe88",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她想起“皇帝”应有的样貌，\n双眼再次燃起强劲的意志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "271574c2121832413f95cda8ac657864281bd7036dd2a04c2c5576dd621873c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38683f035030b0a9edfb3b13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "冰解冻释",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fd3d4d628aedaa552b275a28bbe8285bb287b550a69c8bde91186f9599bd758",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55c27f4c441ed218f3c9cd38",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园例行的“夏季集训”即将开始。\n鲁道夫象征留在学园进行\n最终确认直到最后一刻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8763fe53821e8a7cc00f04774cae457d38f14e92560b51b2776375e827a9ec5b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    }
  ]
}
